            "subheading": "#1",
            "title": "Personalized consultation",
            "content": "<p>Every bespoke project begins with a <strong>personalized design consultation</strong>, where we explore your vision in detail. Together, we discuss design, material selection, pile height, and every subtle detail to ensure the rug perfectly suits your space and purpose. Each conversation is an opportunity to turn your idea into something truly unique.</p>",
